<title>USA: Arlington, Texas, repriced, top yield unchanged.</title>
<headline>Arlington, Texas, repriced, top yield unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said Monday it repriced Arlington, Texas, $38 million waterworks and sewer system refunding bonds, raising the yield in the 2004 maturity.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
